  "Description":      "This AIM receives the image of a page as a Basic Visual Object and produces a Text Object: the lines of text found on the page, in reading order, each a Basic Text Object with its box on the page and its confidence. The box of a line is the Space-Time of the line in the Text Object: SpatialAttitude1 is its top-left corner, SpatialAttitude2 its bottom-right corner, in the pixels of the image (X to the right, Y down). The confidence of a line is in its Data Exchange Metadata.",

